# A Battle Factory singles challenge (decomp scripts_battle_factory.s, frontier_scripts_battle_factory.s): the single
# attendant, SINGLE, LEVEL 50, the save before the challenge (both questions YES), the corridor (a frontier scene)
# and the rental app: three of the six rentals picked in order, YES. The battle room, the first battle won, CONTINUE:
# the next opponent's info, the trade (YES; the first rental given for the beaten trainer's first), the second
# battle forfeited (RUN, a loss). The video question NO, the save on the loss (BattleFactory_SaveOnLoss: record and
# latest streak 1, trades 2: the rental and the trade), the lobby's goodbye. Rentals and trainers are drawn from the
# game's RNG, so they differ by seed; the battles' count and results do not.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 60 platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_BATTLE_FACTORY 21 7 up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until menu 600
# SINGLE
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until menu 600
# LEVEL 50
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until yesno 600
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until yesno 600
+2 press a
+1 release a
+300 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
until app factory 3000
+60 screenshot factory-rent
+0 tap ball:3
+2 tap entry:1
+2 tap ball:4
+2 tap entry:1
+2 tap ball:5
+2 tap entry:1
+2 tap entry:0
until app none 300
+90 press a
+1 release a
+30 press a
+1 release a
+400 press a
+1 release a
+60 press a
+1 release a
until battle 3000
+0 screenshot factory-battle
battle auto 20000
until menu 3000
+0 screenshot factory-corridor
# CONTINUE
+10 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
until yesno 3000
# The trade: YES
+2 press a
+1 release a
until app factory 3000
+30 tap ball:0
+2 tap entry:1
+2 tap ball:0
+2 tap entry:1
+2 tap entry:0
until app none 300
